message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "earth-systems-physics"
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/JinnZ2/earth-systems-physics"
abstract: >
  A coupled differential equation framework mapping Earth physics as
  constraint layers from orbital forcing through biosphere. Includes a
  cascade engine, assumption validator, kicked-relaxor ecosystem dynamics,
  carbon accounting, AMOC hysteresis, permafrost ledgers, and systems-analysis
  audits. Pure Python. Not a climate model. A physics inventory and constraint
  stack.
keywords:
  - earth-systems
  - physics
  - differential-equations
  - cascade-dynamics
  - carbon-accounting
  - biosphere
  - magnomechanical
  - ecosystem-physics
  - kicked-relaxor
  - constraint-layers
  - assumption-validation
  - cc0
